  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/934/100/justinocean.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1345\" height=\"662\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\">一款简单的模组，添加了一种类似下界合金的材质，但它出现在深海海床上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">你需要潜入海底才能找到它。</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\">你可以使用水灵锭和<strong>锻造模板</strong>来升级装备。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/912/748/ea1aeace-2024-07-10-161423.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"361\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">结合 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just-In CAVE</a> 制作更多水灵武器。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">新生物&nbsp;“鲨龙”（Sharkdrake）是海洋的顶级掠食者，它们游动的速度惊人。少数稀有个体拥有鲨鱼鳍。用它们的鳍制成的武器可以提升游泳速度。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/959/235/sharkdrake.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"182\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_1037c087-612e-4e6d-b168-cc1ae97af99a.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_54232867-8b07-4721-8dd1-c1e353c31966.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\"></span></h2>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">鱼类</span></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_3bfcd3af-295f-49b2-a7a9-4a42b06d10ba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"494\" height=\"63\"></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_4a18b214-8e65-474f-bb96-d451e7efab72.gif\" width=\"181\" height=\"160\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_67be3ed5-b677-42f8-ae35-9ea9e6670f38.gif\" width=\"271\" height=\"110\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_1ff08be1-3833-48e8-8c6f-29de079798d1.gif\" width=\"133\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_aba3fcfc-9998-439b-bebb-8dfaab9ce75d.gif\" width=\"140\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_916085ea-2ca4-434e-b707-24ce0e5cc6f8.gif\" width=\"145\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#a5a5a5\">需要依赖 <a style=\"color:#a5a5a5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a> !!!!</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#a5a5a5\">祝你游玩愉快!!!!!<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#a5a5a5\">所有配方均可在 <a style=\"color:#a5a5a5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 中查看！</span></p>\n<p>你也可以点击&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/justinoway/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">'这里'</a>&nbsp;查看我的其他模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_66b3ac9b-9dba-4397-ac85-a748dda2f17a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_ed4c5d95-6b78-4b39-b0ce-ee106820067c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-nether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_8a28576d-9883-4c71-9e2f-291d7a748166.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-wizard-hat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_e1306f44-e3fe-4758-a893-80539b48d110.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-garden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545931/description_72853ade-db70-4112-90c9-b1ca0bd1af78.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-lol-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090007/description_8e2c4f41-8277-4c7a-aa16-ece5a408a323.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066741/description_c4977f41-7a78-41e8-911d-fbd4eded70ef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066741/description_9459cb9d-a740-4e92-b8a4-dd6c0ff68f4c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-blacksmith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1150/122/256/256/638717547899899179.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-kitchen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090007/description_f5c43518-c635-4b41-b335-901dd0ec6399.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-in-bank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1091821/description_c73eca2d-4dba-437d-b237-a9020c261e2c.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#a5a5a5\">这些项目均由我一人独立开发，因此更新进度可能会稍慢。如果你经济宽裕且喜欢我制作的模组，赞助我将能让我有更多时间专注于模组开发，无需为收入担忧。此外，你还可以在赞助留言中告诉我你希望我更新的内容！</span></h6>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjustinoway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://ewebinar.com/hubfs/Ko-fi-Logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"318\" height=\"104\"></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flotsofadding%253fcountry.x%253dTW%2526locale.x%253dzh_TW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1068761/description_590800f8-dda0-4e66-aa70-923107834d70.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"157\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\">这对我真的非常有帮助。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>抱歉我的英语不太好 :(</p>",
